 # WSM Compatibility ISO — localmodconfig whitelist.
 # Hardware: i5-6400 / Gigabyte H170-Gaming 3 / GTX 1050 Ti (GP107, 0x1c82)
 #           Killer E2200 (1969:e091), Realtek ALC892, Samsung 850 EVO + Kingston NVMe.
 # Plus QEMU TCG devices used for the boot proof. Everything else is disabled
 # by `make localmodconfig`; unknown hardware is reported as Unknown, not guessed.
